# Third-party art packs from the owner's libraries (US-T109): their licences forbid redistributing them, so neither
# the source files nor the imported assets are committed. tools/import-*.ps1 rebuilds them; see docs/ThirdPartyArt.md.
# That covers every pack: StarSparrow (US-T109), USC, Ultimate Spaceships Creator (US-T142), and any added later.
Cpp/SourceArt/ThirdParty/
Cpp/Content/ThirdParty/
